<title>USA: CFSB Bancorp Inc raises quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>CFSB Bancorp Inc raises quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>LANSING, Mich. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFSB Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its had raised its quarterly dividend to $0.15 a share, up 10 percent after taking into consideration a 10 percent stock dividend distributed in June.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
